    delphi:hasConfidence "0.74"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "Naturalization and climate data permit the abiotic component to be modeled globally, but direct biotic covariates are limited to experiments and local studies. The 'mainly' causal comparison is therefore restricted." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: For introduced garden plants that survive cultivation, model naturalization success from abiotic climatic suitability and measured competition or herbivory. Strong biotic effects after high abiotic suitability supports mainly indirect limitation." ;
